Question 6. Code revision
Revise the code using nested if, elif, and else statements, and add comments to clarify the logic.

name = input("What's your name? ")
time = int(input("What time is it? "))

if (time < 1200):
    print("Hi "+name + ", good morning!")
if (time < 1800):
    print("Hi "+name + ", good afternoon!")
if (time > 1800):
    print("Hi "+name + ", good evening!")

print("Good Bye")

I changed it to:
name = input("What's your name? ")
time = int(input("What time is it? "))
# Check if it is morning
if time < 1200:
    print("Hi " + name + ", good morning!")
# Check if it is afternoon
elif time < 1800:
    print("Hi " + name + ", good afternoon!")
# Otherwise, it is evening
else:
    print("Hi " + name + ", good evening!")
print("Good Bye")

This is so the good morning, afternoon, & evening messages can be selected based on the correct time.

